## 0. Sprint Definition

**What this sprint is**:
A deliberate, full visual refresh of the BTY product. The 5 prototype screens (Lobby / Play / Resolve / Foundry Home / Center Home) become the **official BTY design system**. cream / foundry-purple are deprecated and removed.

**What this sprint is NOT**:
- NOT a runtime change. AL-2-D-P1 freeze and worker e9e179ed are preserved.
- NOT a feature addition. No new product capabilities.
- NOT a behavioral change. Same 7-step canonical, same scenario flow, same hidden stats logic.

**Why now**:
Decision 2026-05-11: cream + foundry-purple were placeholder tones. The 5 prototypes built through claude.ai/design represent BTY's actual design intent. Product identity stalled while two design systems coexist; this sprint resolves it.

