## 4. Guards (apply to every dispatch in this sprint)

**G1 — Runtime invariant**
Touched files must NOT include: `src/data/scenario/`, `src/lib/bty/runtime/`, `src/app/api/arena/runtime/`, `wrangler.toml`. Any change to these breaks AL-2-D-P1 freeze and requires explicit override.

**G2 — Memory hot files**
Do NOT touch unless explicitly scoped: `src/lib/llm.ts`, `getMyPageIdentityState.ts`, `next-env.mjs`. Per memory items #3, #10, #30.

**G3 — Test id preservation**
Every component touched by Stage C MUST preserve its test ids. New components MAY add test ids but must not remove existing ones. List per memory #10 codebase verification.

**G4 — Inventory-first**
No spec, dispatch, or commit without inventory step. Per memory items #8, #15, #20. Minimum signals required: (a) memory/spec, (b) code/runtime refs, (c) actual serving/data path.

**G5 — Single-signal verification ban**
For any deploy state question: 3 cross-signals required (Version ID + git log HEAD + actual code execution). Per memory #11.

**G6 — Token system completeness**
Stage B must define ALL 25 tokens (12 base + 4 cyan + 2 amber + 5 warm + 2 motion). No partial token sets.

**G7 — Commander wording runtime qualification**
Per memory #18. No bare "메모리 반영 완료" / "commit 완료" — always qualify which runtime (Anthropic conversational / Hanbit harness / outer repo / sandbox).

